<title>USA: Unocal Corp Q1 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Unocal Corp Q1 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.57		    $0.47</p>
<p> Net			144,000		  124,000</p>
<p> Revs		   1,456,000		1,201,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 251,000		  247,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings from continuing operations totaled $188 million, or $0.75 a share, compared with $131 million, or $0.50 a share.</p>
<p>First Call Q1 earnings per share consensus: $0.71.</p>
</text>
